9x+48\n$$\n\nhas infinitely many solutions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\nm+8=19.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $m,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we have\n\n$$\n8n=48.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $n,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $m=11$ and $n=6,$ we have\n\n$$\nm+n=11+6=17.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["1685aded-b577-5ed8-90cf-3a8f75f8adf6"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "7f507488-4595-522d-987d-9cb1830b28d4" :answer/id #uuid "7f507488-4595-522d-987d-9cb1830b28d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "85a2d72a-110b-5ef3-91a7-6c6ea19a612f" :answer/id #uuid "85a2d72a-110b-5ef3-91a7-6c6ea19a612f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "88" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b5e87be2-7f84-5050-8450-0a88afe51a84" :answer/id #uuid "b5e87be2-7f84-5050-8450-0a88afe51a84" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e45d5b04-882a-57f9-a42e-18c402ad7f7b" :answer/id #uuid "e45d5b04-882a-57f9-a42e-18c402ad7f7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "22" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "809ccd9d-fcfa-5f07-b35d-ba36d56528a3" :answer/id #uuid "809ccd9d-fcfa-5f07-b35d-ba36d56528a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fecfe7d0-ddbf-5842-ad10-352285c2f4d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "fecfe7d0-ddbf-5842-ad10-352285c2f4d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["7f507488-4595-522d-987d-9cb1830b28d4" "85a2d72a-110b-5ef3-91a7-6c6ea19a612f" "b5e87be2-7f84-5050-8450-0a88afe51a84" "e45d5b04-882a-57f9-a42e-18c402ad7f7b" "809ccd9d-fcfa-5f07-b35d-ba36d56528a3"] :answer-field/correct "7f507488-4595-522d-987d-9cb1830b28d4" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "436cab40-c84e-51f6-a518-ef754e1d23e8" :question/id #uuid "436cab40-c84e-51f6-a518-ef754e1d23e8" :question/problem "Consider the equation\n\n$$\n(m+7)x+8n=9x+88\n$$\n\nwhere $m$ and $n$ are constants. Given that this equation has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $m+n?$" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax+b=cx+d\n$$\n\nwhere $a,b,c,$ and $d$ are constants. This equation has infinitely many solutions if \n\n$$\na=c\\,\\text{and}\\,b=d.\n$$\n\nTo determine the values of $m$ and $n$ such that the equation\n\n$$\n(m+7)x+8n=9x+88\n$$\n\nhas infinitely many solutions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\nm+7=9.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $m,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we have\n\n$$\n8n=88.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $n,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =11.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $m=2$ and $n=11,$ we have\n\n$$\nm+n=2+11=13.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["fecfe7d0-ddbf-5842-ad10-352285c2f4d4"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "c305d1ca-2a7e-5395-b01d-7f73d8b68b81" :answer/id #uuid "c305d1ca-2a7e-5395-b01d-7f73d8b68b81" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "94e8a50e-ea95-52e9-9247-89cc6599449e" :answer-field/id #uuid "94e8a50e-ea95-52e9-9247-89cc6599449e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["c305d1ca-2a7e-5395-b01d-7f73d8b68b81"] :answer-field/correct "c305d1ca-2a7e-5395-b01d-7f73d8b68b81" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "af3151d7-d56f-5c03-a92e-cf11481af995" :question/id #uuid "af3151d7-d56f-5c03-a92e-cf11481af995" :question/problem "Consider the equation\n\n$$\n(-s+15)x+4t=3x+4\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ and $t$ are constants. Given that this equation has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $s+t?$\n\n$s+t=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax+b=cx+d\n$$\n\nwhere $a,b,c,$ and $d$ are constants. This equation has infinitely many solutions if \n\n$$\na=c\\,\\text{and}\\,b=d.\n$$\n\nTo determine the values of $s$ and $t$ such that the equation\n\n$$\n(-s+15)x+4t=3x+4\n$$\n\nhas infinitely many solutions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n-s+15=3.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $s,$ we get\n\n$$\ns=12.\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we have\n\n$$\n4t=4.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $t,$ we get\n\n$$\nt=1.\n$$\n\nFinally, since $s=12$ and $t=1,$ we have\n\n$$\ns+t=12+1=13.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["94e8a50e-ea95-52e9-9247-89cc6599449e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "29420e57-07ec-566d-b584-32e9a65019be" :answer/id #uuid "29420e57-07ec-566d-b584-32e9a65019be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "74d8a1c6-b3bb-5405-b5c5-2de709852649" :answer-field/id #uuid "74d8a1c6-b3bb-5405-b5c5-2de709852649" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["29420e57-07ec-566d-b584-32e9a65019be"] :answer-field/correct "29420e57-07ec-566d-b584-32e9a65019be" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "d2ad0a7a-e832-5a60-bb09-72e5ecf114bf" :question/id #uuid "d2ad0a7a-e832-5a60-bb09-72e5ecf114bf" :question/problem "Consider the equation\n\n$$\n5tx+(1-m)=55x+4\n$$\n\nwhere $t$ and $m$ are constants. Given that this equation has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $t+m?$\n\n$t+m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax+b=cx+d\n$$\n\nwhere $a,b,c,$ and $d$ are constants. This equation has infinitely many solutions if \n\n$$\na=c\\,\\text{and}\\,b=d.\n$$\n\nTo determine the values of $t$ and $m$ such that the equation\n\n$$\n5tx+(1-m)=55x+4\n$$\n\nhas infinitely many solutions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n5t=55.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $t,$ we get\n\n$$\nt=11.\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we get\n\n$$\n1-m=4.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $m,$ we get\n\n$$\nm=-3.\n$$\n\nFinally, since $t=11$ and $m=-3,$ we have\n\n$$\nt+m=11+(-3)=8.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["74d8a1c6-b3bb-5405-b5c5-2de709852649"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e054d18f-0abd-534e-af79-b4becb7e8af4" :answer/id #uuid "e054d18f-0abd-534e-af79-b4becb7e8af4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "bf404ba6-be51-5d74-9701-f28660bc675d" :answer-field/id #uuid "bf404ba6-be51-5d74-9701-f28660bc675d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["e054d18f-0abd-534e-af79-b4becb7e8af4"] :answer-field/correct "e054d18f-0abd-534e-af79-b4becb7e8af4" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "475d1245-f209-5a1a-94d0-b61255568fb1" :question/id #uuid "475d1245-f209-5a1a-94d0-b61255568fb1" :question/problem "Consider the equation\n\n$$\n(-s+16)x+2t=7x+12\n$$\n\nwhere $s$ and $t$ are constants. Given that this equation has infinitely many solutions, what is the value of $s+t?$\n\n$s+t=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax+b=cx+d\n$$\n\nwhere $a,b,c,$ and $d$ are constants. This equation has infinitely many solutions if \n\n$$\na=c\\,\\text{and}\\,b=d.\n$$\n\nTo determine the values of $s$ and $t$ such that the equation\n\n$$\n(-s+16)x+2t=7x+12\n$$\n\nhas infinitely many solutions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n-s+16=7.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $s,$ we get\n\n$$\ns=9.\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we have\n\n$$\n2t=12.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $t,$ we get\n\n$$\nt=6.\n$$\n\nFinally, since $s=9$ and $t=6,$ we have\n\n$$\ns+t=9+6=15.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["bf404ba6-be51-5d74-9701-f28660bc675d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "a8a3fd9e-9b0f-54b0-b19c-26e749314cab" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186110721.py"} [:db/add 17592186110721 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186110721 :knowledge-point/questions ["bae891b2-2044-5361-b2ef-88211b0b3d9f" "436cab40-c84e-51f6-a518-ef754e1d23e8" "af3151d7-d56f-5c03-a92e-cf11481af995" "d2ad0a7a-e832-5a60-bb09-72e5ecf114bf" "475d1245-f209-5a1a-94d0-b61255568fb1"]} [:db/ensure 17592186110721 :knowledge-point/validate]]
